# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 开发机（core.autocrlf=true）签出后被改成 CRLF，
# 造成整文件「假改动」。二进制文件由 Git 自动识别，这里显式标注 PDF/Office/压缩包以防误判。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
